                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNG ZUR INTERAKTIVEN UND DATENSCHUTZBEWAHRENDEN KOMMUNIKATION ZWISCHEN EINEM SERVER UND EINER BENUTZERVORRICHTUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET APPAREIL DE COMMUNICATION INTERACTIVE ET PRÉSERVANT LA CONFIDENTIALITÉ ENTRE UN SERVEUR ET UN DISPOSITIF UTILISATEUR</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD AND APPARATUS FOR INTERACTIVE AND PRIVACY-PRESERVING COMMUNICATION BETWEEN A SERVER AND A USER DEVICE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Methods and apparatuses for interactive communication between a user device and a server are described. Therein, one or more notifications are provided to a user on the user device, and reaction data indicative of a reaction of the user to the one or more notifications is acquired. Further, based at least in part on the acquired reaction data, a plurality of sentiment scores is determined and, based on comparing at least two of said sentiment scores, a final sentiment score is determined.</p>
            </abstract>
